OL,3,GNEWSAUp-to-date national statistics
OL,4,Astill months away
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe release of up-to-date statistics on
OL,7,Fthe size of Guernsey's population and
OL,8,Feconomy are still months away,
OL,9,Faccording to Policy and Resources
OL,10,F(P&R), after problems with the Revenue
OL,11,FService.
OL,13,FPresident of P&R Lindsay de Sausmarez
OL,14,Fsaid she was concerned about delays to
OL,15,Fthe publication of "important national
OL,16,Fstatistics".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
