OL,3,GNEWSAUp-to-date national statistics
OL,4,Astill months away
OL,5,
OL,6,FIssues at the Revenue Service have been
OL,7,Fwell-publicised after the States Chief
OL,8,FExecutive Boley Smillie admitted a
OL,9,Fmultimillion-pound IT transformation
OL,10,Fproject at the service had delivered
OL,11,Flittle to no benefits.
OL,13,FDeputy de Sausmarez said she could not
OL,14,Fgive a firm date for when the data
OL,15,Fwould be available.
